          "notes": "Historical procedural Three.js reconstruction, replaced upstream by the artwork cutout. No external 3D model. React/Three.js and host integration are not bundled; no active representation is declared.",
          "files": [
            "LICENSE",
            "jaeger_ai/interfaces/ui/src/avatar/JaegerAvatar.tsx",
            "jaeger_ai/interfaces/ui/src/avatar/jaegerAvatar.css",
